            "title": "U.S.-China trade negotiations continue after talks end with \"new ...",
            "snippets": [
              "They plan to work through remaining issues, Xinhua reports.",
              "# U.S.-China trade negotiations continue after talks end with \"new progress\"\nChina's Vice Premier Liu He (left) in a February meeting with President Trump (right) in the White House. File photo: Mandel Ngan/AFP/Getty Images\n\nThe U.S. and China \"smoothly concluded\" the latest round of trade talks and would work through remaining issues \"through various effective means,\" the Chinese state-run Xinhua news agency reported Saturday",
